open a terminal and go to the main directory (gxinterface) :
		cd where_you_have_decompressed/gxinterface/gxinterface
	regenerate by :
		./autogen.sh
	configure by ( --prefix=/usr for debian/ubuntu users ) :
		./configure --prefix=/usr
	compilation :
		make 
	installation ( or use checkinstall to make a .deb ) :
		sudo make install 
	or 
		sudo checkinstall -D --fstrans=no --install=yes 
	( in checkinstall set the number version (3) of gxsynth ex: 0.0.1 )
	
